@host = http://localhost:8080

# Vagas do seed
@vagaMoto = 11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111
@vagaPadrao = 22222222-2222-2222-2222-222222222222
@vagaGrande = 33333333-3333-3333-3333-333333333333
@vagaEmManutencao = 44444444-4444-4444-4444-444444444444
@vagaOcupada = 44444444-4444-4444-4444-444444444443

# Id inexistente, para os cenarios de 404
@idInexistente = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000

###############################################################################
# RF01 — Gestao de vagas
###############################################################################

### [201] Cadastra vaga
POST {{host}}/v1/vagas
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "codigo": "B-01",
  "tipo": "PADRAO"
}

### [409] Codigo de vaga duplicado (RF01.1) — mesma request do bloco acima
POST {{host}}/v1/vagas
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "codigo": "B-01",
  "tipo": "PADRAO"
}

### [400] Validacao: codigo vazio e tipo ausente — a resposta deve listar os dois campos (nao implementado)
POST {{host}}/v1/vagas
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "codigo": "",
  "tipo": null
}

### [400] Codigo acima de 10 caracteres
POST {{host}}/v1/vagas
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "codigo": "CODIGO-MUITO-LONGO",
  "tipo": "GRANDE"
}

### [400] Tipo de vaga inexistente no enum
POST {{host}}/v1/vagas
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "codigo": "B-02",
  "tipo": "GIGANTE"
}

### [200] Lista todas as vagas (sem paginacao — ver premissa 9 no README)
GET {{host}}/v1/vagas

### [200] Filtra por tipo
GET {{host}}/v1/vagas?tipo=MOTO

### [200] Filtra por status
GET {{host}}/v1/vagas?status=MANUTENCAO

### [200] Filtros combinados
GET {{host}}/v1/vagas?tipo=PADRAO&status=LIVRE

### [400] Valor de enum invalido em query param — nunca 500
GET {{host}}/v1/vagas?tipo=GIGANTE

### [200] Consulta vaga por id
GET {{host}}/v1/vagas/{{vagaPadrao}}

### [404] Vaga inexistente
GET {{host}}/v1/vagas/{{idInexistente}}

### [400] UUID malformado no path
GET {{host}}/v1/vagas/nao-e-uuid

### [200] Envia vaga para manutencao
PUT {{host}}/v1/vagas/{{vagaPadrao}}/status
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "MANUTENCAO"
}

### [200] Devolve vaga para operacao
PUT {{host}}/v1/vagas/{{vagaPadrao}}/status
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "LIVRE"
}

### [400] OCUPADA nao pode ser definida manualmente (RF01.3)
PUT {{host}}/v1/vagas/{{vagaPadrao}}/status
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "OCUPADA"
}

### [409] OCUPADA nao pode ser enviada pra MANUTENCAO
PUT {{host}}/v1/vagas/{{vagaOcupada}}/status
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "MANUTENCAO"
}


### [400] Status ausente
PUT {{host}}/v1/vagas/{{vagaPadrao}}/status
Content-Type: application/json

{
}

### [404] Alteracao de status em vaga inexistente
PUT {{host}}/v1/vagas/{{idInexistente}}/status
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "LIVRE"
}


